{title: I Will Sing Your Praises}
{song_number: 43}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse}
[Em]Father God, I wonder how I [D]managed to exist
without the [C]knowledge of Your parenthood
[D]and Your loving [B7]care. But [Em]now I am Your child,
I am a[D]dopted in Your [C]fami[Em]ly and I can never
be alone, 'cause [D]Father God, You're [B7]there beside me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Em]I will [C]sing Your praises, [D]I will [G]sing Your praises,
[Em]I will sing Your praises [Am7]for ever[B7]more.
[D]For ever[Em]more.
{end_of_chorus}
